  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h1>Are You Looking For Weight Loss Surgery Or Weight Loss Medications In Indianapolis?</h1>\n<p>If you’re looking for weight loss surgery or medications in Indianapolis, JourneyLite is your trusted team!&nbsp; We have been serving patients from all over Indiana for years, however up until now we have only had office locations in Ohio and Kentucky.&nbsp; This is changing in 2024, as we are excited to announce the opening of our fifth JourneyLite Physicians office!</p>\n<p>The new office address location is:</p>\n<p>33 E County Line Road<br>\nGreenwood, IN 46143</p>\n<p>Phone: (463) 237-5999</p>\n<p><strong>In celebration of the new office, we are offering 10 free medical weight loss consultations with Dr. Trace Curry at the Indy location!</strong>&nbsp; Just click on the appointment button below and type “free Indy” in the comment section of the appointment form. These appointments will be on Tuesday, December 5th or Tuesday, December 19th.</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n<div class=\"wpb_gmaps_widget wpb_content_element\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_map_wraper\"><iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d5137.064642017775!2d-86.10811902262822!3d39.63538107157575!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x886b5cda5b8a5e21%3A0x31adcd9d2a81bb5c!2s33%20E%20County%20Line%20Rd%2C%20Greenwood%2C%20IN%2046143!5e1!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1695841240305!5m2!1sen!2sus\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe></div></div></div>\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/appointment-request/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"252\" height=\"73\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2014/02/AppointmentRequest.jpeg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"\" title=\"Appointment Request\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2>We will be offering consultations for weight loss surgery in Indianapolis and other procedures such as:</h2>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">Gastric Sleeve (VSG)</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/surgical-weight-loss/gastric-sleeve-vsg/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"569\" height=\"589\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/SleevePic.gif\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"Vertical Sleeve Gastrectomy\" title=\"Gastric Sleeve\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">Gastric Bypass</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/surgical-weight-loss/gastric-bypass/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"501\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/05/gastric_bypass.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"gastric bypass anatomy\" title=\"gastric_bypass\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/05/gastric_bypass.jpg.webp 500w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/05/gastric_bypass-180x180.jpg.webp 180w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/05/gastric_bypass-150x150.jpg.webp 150w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/05/gastric_bypass-300x301.jpg.webp 300w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/05/gastric_bypass-144x144.jpg.webp 144w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/05/gastric_bypass-50x50.jpg.webp 50w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/05/gastric_bypass-100x100.jpg.webp 100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">SADI-S (SIPS Procedure)</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/surgical-weight-loss/sips-procedure/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"647\" height=\"692\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/02/SADI-S.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"Anatomy of a SADI-S procedure, also known as SIPS or LDS.\" title=\"SADI-S\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/02/SADI-S.jpg.webp 647w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/02/SADI-S-280x300.jpg.webp 280w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/02/SADI-S-93x100.jpg.webp 93w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/02/SADI-S-300x321.jpg.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 647px) 100vw, 647px\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">Spatz Balloon</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/spatz-adjustable-gastric-balloon/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"749\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/08/spatz.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"Spatz gastric balloon\" title=\"spatz\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/08/spatz.jpg.webp 1024w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/08/spatz-660x483.jpg.webp 660w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/08/spatz-300x219.jpg.webp 300w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/08/spatz-768x562.jpg.webp 768w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/08/spatz-100x73.jpg.webp 100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">Orbera Balloon</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/weight-loss-medications/orbera-gastric-balloon/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"294\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2015/08/ORBERA-In-Stomach-web.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"Orbera Intra-gastric Balloon\" title=\"ORBERA In Stomach\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2015/08/ORBERA-In-Stomach-web.jpg.webp 400w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2015/08/ORBERA-In-Stomach-web-300x221.jpg.webp 300w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2015/08/ORBERA-In-Stomach-web-100x74.jpg.webp 100w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p>We will also be offering medical weight loss consultations for medications such as:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://journeylite.com/wegovy/\">Semaglutide (Ozempic/Wegovy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://journeylite.com/zepbound-tirzepatide-a-new-injectable-fda-approved-weight-loss-drug/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tirzepatide (Mounjaro/Zepbound)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://journeylite.com/weight-loss-medications/\">Adipex (phentermine)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://journeylite.com/weight-loss-medications/\">Qsymia</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://journeylite.com/weight-loss-medications/\">Contrave</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/appointment-request/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"252\" height=\"73\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2014/02/AppointmentRequest.jpeg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"\" title=\"Appointment Request\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n<div class=\"wpb_gmaps_widget wpb_content_element\"><h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_map_heading\">JourneyLite Physicians-5 Office Locations To Serve You!</h2><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"wpb_map_wraper\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/1/embed?mid=1J8ReAKHRzGOtlx-SdBN4sbbmLJK0DaQ&amp;ehbc=2E312F\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p><strong>About JourneyLite Surgery Center</strong></p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3211\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3211\" style=\"width: 323px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3211\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/02/EvendaleHealthcareCenter.png\" alt=\"Our main office and surgery center!\" width=\"323\" height=\"215\"><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3211\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">JourneyLite Physicians &amp; JourneyLite Surgery Center</figcaption></figure>\n<p>JourneyLite Surgery Center was founded by Dr. Trace Curry in 2007, and is located in Cincinnati, Ohio. The center is dedicated to the care of weight loss surgery, plastics, spine, and pain management patients. JourneyLite is known for many “firsts” in the mid-west, such as the first outpatient same-day gastric sleeve surgery. Dr. Curry and JourneyLite published one of the largest series on the safety and efficacy of same-day discharge gastric sleeve procedures, showing equal results to patients who were kept for 1-2 days in the hospital afterwards.</p>\n<p>JourneyLite is a MBSAQIP-accredited bariatric surgery center of excellence by the American College of Surgeons and also carries several other quality designations such as:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.bcbs.com/about-us/capabilities-initiatives/blue-distinction/blue-distinction-specialty-care\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anthem Blue Distinction Plus in bariatric surgery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.optum.com/business/health-plans/members/medical-benefits/bariatric.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">United Healthcare Optum Bariatric Center of Excellence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aetna.com/individuals-families/member-rights-resources/commitment-quality/institutes-of-quality.html\">Aetna Institute of Quality</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Our Doctors</h3>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">Dr. Trace Curry</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"588\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/07/6862_web.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"\" title=\"6862_web\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/07/6862_web.jpg.webp 420w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/07/6862_web-214x300.jpg.webp 214w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/07/6862_web-71x100.jpg.webp 71w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/07/6862_web-300x420.jpg.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 420px) 100vw, 420px\"></div>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">Dr. James Augusta</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"588\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/08/drAugustaHeadShotWeb.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"james augusta\" title=\"drAugustaHeadShotWeb\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/08/drAugustaHeadShotWeb.jpg.webp 420w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/08/drAugustaHeadShotWeb-214x300.jpg.webp 214w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/08/drAugustaHeadShotWeb-71x100.jpg.webp 71w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2023/08/drAugustaHeadShotWeb-300x420.jpg.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 420px) 100vw, 420px\"></div>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p>Dr. Trace Curry and Dr. James Augusta both specialize in the disease of obesity. They have the most comprehensive practice in the mid-west and treat patients from all over the United States. Whether it be surgery, incisionless procedures, or weight loss medications, our doctors have the experience and the expertise to help you find an option that works for you. With our new location, they will be offering consultations for weight loss surgery in Indianapolis and their team will be providing pre and post-op care!</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/appointment-request/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"252\" height=\"73\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2014/02/AppointmentRequest.jpeg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"\" title=\"Appointment Request\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div>",
  "bodyMarkdown": "# Are You Looking For Weight Loss Surgery Or Weight Loss Medications In Indianapolis?\n\nIf you’re looking for weight loss surgery or medications in Indianapolis, JourneyLite is your trusted team!  We have been serving patients from all over Indiana for years, however up until now we have only had office locations in Ohio and Kentucky.  This is changing in 2024, as we are excited to announce the opening of our fifth JourneyLite Physicians office!\n\nThe new office address location is:\n\n33 E County Line Road\nGreenwood, IN 46143\n\nPhone: (463) 237-5999\n\n**In celebration of the new office, we are offering 10 free medical weight loss consultations with Dr. Trace Curry at the Indy location!**  Just click on the appointment button below and type “free Indy” in the comment section of the appointment form. These appointments will be on Tuesday, December 5th or Tuesday, December 19th.\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/appointment-request/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n## We will be offering consultations for weight loss surgery in Indianapolis and other procedures such as:\n\n## Gastric Sleeve (VSG)\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/surgical-weight-loss/gastric-sleeve-vsg/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n## Gastric Bypass\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/surgical-weight-loss/gastric-bypass/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n## SADI-S (SIPS Procedure)\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/surgical-weight-loss/sips-procedure/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n## Spatz Balloon\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/spatz-adjustable-gastric-balloon/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n## Orbera Balloon\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/weight-loss-medications/orbera-gastric-balloon/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\nWe will also be offering medical weight loss consultations for medications such as:\n\n-   (https://journeylite.com/wegovy/)\n-   (https://journeylite.com/zepbound-tirzepatide-a-new-injectable-fda-approved-weight-loss-drug/)\n-   (https://journeylite.com/weight-loss-medications/)\n-   (https://journeylite.com/weight-loss-medications/)\n-   (https://journeylite.com/weight-loss-medications/)\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/appointment-request/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n## JourneyLite Physicians-5 Office Locations To Serve You!\n\n**About JourneyLite Surgery Center**\n\nJourneyLite Physicians & JourneyLite Surgery Center\n\nJourneyLite Surgery Center was founded by Dr. Trace Curry in 2007, and is located in Cincinnati, Ohio. The center is dedicated to the care of weight loss surgery, plastics, spine, and pain management patients. JourneyLite is known for many “firsts” in the mid-west, such as the first outpatient same-day gastric sleeve surgery. Dr. Curry and JourneyLite published one of the largest series on the safety and efficacy of same-day discharge gastric sleeve procedures, showing equal results to patients who were kept for 1-2 days in the hospital afterwards.\n\nJourneyLite is a MBSAQIP-accredited bariatric surgery center of excellence by the American College of Surgeons and also carries several other quality designations such as:\n\n-   (https://www.bcbs.com/about-us/capabilities-initiatives/blue-distinction/blue-distinction-specialty-care)\n-   (https://www.optum.com/business/health-plans/members/medical-benefits/bariatric.html)\n-   (https://www.aetna.com/individuals-families/member-rights-resources/commitment-quality/institutes-of-quality.html)\n\n### Our Doctors\n\n## Dr. Trace Curry\n\n## Dr. James Augusta\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/appointment-request/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey\"></a>",
